      "proposal": "Evaluate encryption methods that are energy-efficient to align with sustainability goals."
    },
    {
      "id": "RES-05",
      "stance": "oppose",
      "proposal": "Ensure that compliance efforts consider sustainability impacts to find a balance."
    },
    {
      "id": "SAF-07",
